      ],
      "id": "03af884e-081d-4981-9caa-1e3005dd7297",
      "name": "When clicking ‘Execute workflow’"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "=define",
        "text": "=You create a daily digest of Substack newsletters for me.\n\n1. Use the \"Get many messages in Gmail\" tool to fetch Substack emails.\n   Only include newsletter posts and notes. Skip account emails such as\n   sign-in links, receipts, and subscription confirmations.\n\n2. If there are no newsletter emails, stop. Do not send anything.\n\n3. For each newsletter email, create one separate card. Do not merge emails.\n   - Author or publication name\n   - Subject\n   - The direct URL to the post or note, taken from the email body\n   - 3 key takeaways, each one sentence\n   - A recommended action: exactly one of \"Read full post\", \"Skim\", or \"Archive\"\n\n4. Build the digest using exactly this HTML template:\n\n<div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #202124; max-width: 650px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #1a73e8; border-bottom: 2px solid #e8eaed; padding-bottom: 8px;\">📬 Daily Substack Digest</h2>\n\n  <!-- Repeat for each newsletter -->\n  <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e0e2e6; border-left: 4px solid #1a73e8; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 16px 0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #202124;\">[Author / Publication] — <em>[Subject]</em></h3>\n    <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 4px 0; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: #5f6368;\">Key Takeaways:</p>\n    <ul style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #3c4043;\">\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">[Takeaway 1]</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">[Takeaway 2]</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\">[Takeaway 3]</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px dashed #e8eaed;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #5f6368;\"><strong>Action:</strong> <em>[Action]</em></span>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp;\n      <a href=\"[POST_URL]\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a73e8; text-decoration: none;\">Read original post &rarr;</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- End repeat -->\n</div>\n\n5. Call the \"Send a message in Gmail\" tool exactly once.\n   - Subject: 📬 Daily Substack Digest – {{ $now.toFormat('d LLL yyyy') }}\n   - Message: the complete HTML from step 4. Do not use markdown.",
        "options": {
          "maxIterations": 10
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -112,
